  parts=[
    Part(
      text="""**Definition**: Linear transforms involve vectors such as $a_1$ and $a_2$ in $\mathbb{R}^2$ that span a parallelogram, where any vector $v$ in their span can be written as a linear combination of orthogonal vectors obtained via the Gram-Schmidt process.

