## 3. System Integration

To wire these components together, initialize the communication stack, stepper controller, and sensor interface inside the main embedded loop.

```c
#include "azotyl.h"
#include "stepper.h"
#include "sensor.h"

int main(void) {
    // Hardware and protocol initialization
    uart_init(9600);
    azotyl_init();
    stepper_init();
    sensor_init();
    
    while (1) {
        // Process incoming network or serial messages
        azotyl_process();
        
        // Read the absolute sensor position
        int16_t raw_pos = sensor_read();
        
        // Retrieve network-adjusted offset for Azotyl node 0
        int16_t offset = azotyl_get_offset(0);
        
        // Compute target position including Azotyl offset
        int16_t target_position = raw_pos + offset;
        
        // Drive stepper motor toward the target position
        stepper_update(target_position);
        
        // Optional: slow down loop iteration for stability
        delay_ms(10);
    }
}
